Here are some things you could try:
- First remove existing installation of GGIR, you may need to delete it manually from the R package library directory.
- Update all packages via Tools > Check for package updates.
- If your work IT system does not like you to install packages manually, you could get around it by changing the default R package storage library to a location you have rights for. I have encountered this once and after I changed the default path it worked for me. You may need to reinstall R for this.

