Hi Nicolle,
If your research focus is on sleep then use the GGIR part 4 output, because it focusses on estimating sleep only for as many nights as possible.

The focus of part 5 is on full day time use with sleep as only one of the variables. Here days are ignored if they are not of interests to time-use analysis, even if they may be interesting for sleep analysis. The sleep variable from part 4 are copied into the part5 output for reference purposes.
Best, Vincent

